# Everything a scripted run does that would write the user's settings in a
# normal run. Driven by tests/settings_isolation.cmake (the `settings_isolation`
# CTest), which then checks that no settings file was written.
# Run from the repo root.

# Starting the app fills in shortcuts.ini; an opened file goes to recent.ini.
open tests/testdata/cfa_asiair_rggb.fits
waitloaded
assert channels 3

# A non-default demosaic method is saved as a preference (preferences.ini).
debayer rggb bilinear
waitloaded
assert channels 3
